{"id":72601,"date":"2021-05-21T22:13:59","date_gmt":"2021-05-21T15:13:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/?p=72601"},"modified":"2021-05-21T22:13:59","modified_gmt":"2021-05-21T15:13:59","slug":"rapat-koordinasi-pimpinan-bumd-jember-dengan-bupati-hendy","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/rapat-koordinasi-pimpinan-bumd-jember-dengan-bupati-hendy\/","title":{"rendered":"Rapat Koordinasi Pimpinan BUMD Jember dengan Bupati Hendy"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-72616\" src=\"http:\/\/humas.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170850_IMG_9763-scaled-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" \/><\/p>\n<p>JEMBER &#8211; Bupati Jember Ir. H. Hendy Siswanto mengumpulkan seluruh pimpinan dari masing-masing Badan Usaha Milik Daerah (BUMD) di antaranya PDP Kahyangan, Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan, RSD. dr. Soebandi, RSD. Kalisat dan RSD Balung.<\/p>\n<p>Rapat berlangsung di Pendopo Wahyawibawagraha, Jumat (21\/05\/2021).<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-72601 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170853_IMG_9764-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170853_IMG_9764-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170949_IMG_9768-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170949_IMG_9768-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170151_IMG_9741-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170151_IMG_9741-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170219_IMG_9742-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170219_IMG_9742-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170233_IMG_9743-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170233_IMG_9743-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170311_IMG_9746-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170311_IMG_9746-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170327_IMG_9748-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170327_IMG_9748-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170426_IMG_9751-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170426_IMG_9751-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Tujuan Bupati Hendy mengumpulkan seluruh pimpinan dari masing-masing BUMD, untuk menyatukan misi dalam meningkatkan Pendapatan Asli Daerah (PAD) yang selanjutnya akan berdampak positif bagi pembangunan Kabupaten Jember.<\/p>\n<p>Bupati Hendy menyampaikan targetnya tahun ini PAD Jember dapat meningkat, dari sebelumnya senilai Rp. 700 miliar bisa meningkat mencapai Rp. 2,5 triliun pada tahun ini.<\/p>\n<p>Hendy optimis dengan target pendapatan tersebut dapat dicapai mengingat banyak sekali potensi Jember yang belum digarap secara maksimal.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-72601 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170532_IMG_9756-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170532_IMG_9756-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170615_IMG_9758-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170615_IMG_9758-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170709_IMG_9759-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170709_IMG_9759-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170713_IMG_9760-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170713_IMG_9760-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170800_IMG_9761-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170800_IMG_9761-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170814_IMG_9762-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170814_IMG_9762-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170917_IMG_9766-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170917_IMG_9766-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170924_IMG_9767-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/20210521170924_IMG_9767-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Dalam rapat tersebut juga membahas kendala yang dihadapi masing-masing BUMD dan mencari solusi bersama.<\/p>\n<p>Bupati Hendy menekankan setiap BUMD untuk proaktif dan saling bersinergi dalam mewujudkan pembangunan Jember yang lebih baik ke depannya. (ipf)<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>JEMBER &#8211; Bupati Jember Ir. H. Hendy Siswanto mengumpulkan seluruh pimpinan dari masing-masing Badan Usaha Milik Daerah (BUMD) di antaranya PDP Kahyangan, Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan, RSD. dr. Soebandi, RSD. Kalisat dan RSD Balung. Rapat berlangsung di Pendopo Wahyawibawagraha, Jumat (21\/05\/2021). Tujuan Bupati Hendy mengumpulkan seluruh pimpinan dari masing-masing BUMD, untuk menyatukan misi dalam meningkatkan Pendapatan &hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":72616,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[3,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-72601","post","type-po